{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2023-05-04 06:02:00', 'title': 'DAVITA CELEBRATES CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP ACHIEVEMENTS, RELEASES ITS 2022 COMMUNITY CARE REPORT', 'text': "DENVER , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DAVITA INC. TODAY PUBLISHED ITS 2022 COMMUNITY CARE REPORT, REINFORCING ITS LONG-STANDING COMMITMENT TO CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP AND HIGHLIGHTING MEANINGFUL PROGRESS MADE TOWARD MEETING THE 2025 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) GOALS IT SET IN 2021. GUIDED BY ITS TRILOGY OF CARE – CARING FOR OUR PATIENTS, CARING FOR EACH OTHER AND CARING FOR OUR WORLD – DAVITA'S AMBITIOUS, VALUES-BASED GOALS ARE ORGANIZED ACROSS FIVE STRATEGIC PILLARS: PATIENT CARE TEAMMATE ENGAGEMENT ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP CARING FOR COMMUNITIES LEADING WITH INTEGRITY AND ACCOUNTABILITY IN 2022, DAVITA TEAMMATES DROVE INITIATIVES THAT ADVANCED ITS GOALS AND HELD THE COMPANY ACCOUNTABLE TO ITS COMMITMENT TO BETTER THE COMMUNITIES IT SERVES."}